flowchart TB
  X["Input a · M × D"] --> LN["LayerNorm: μ = mean(a)"]
  X --> RMS["RMSNorm: r² = mean(a²)"]
  LN --> C["Centered a − μ"]
  C --> V["σ² = mean((a − μ)²)"]
  V --> LZ["z = (a − μ) / σ"]
  RMS --> RZ["z = a / r"]
  LZ --> A["Per-channel gain g · optional bias b"]
  RZ --> A
  A --> Y["Output · M × D"]
